# scripts/skill-prose-lint.patterns — PRD-build-skill-instruction-single-
# source R4: one extended grep -E pattern per line, checked against every
# fenced code block in SKILL.md OUTSIDE the canonical section marked
# `<!-- single-source: archive-gate -->`. A match fails skill-prose-
# lint.sh, naming the offending line. Blank lines and lines starting with
# `#` are ignored.
#
# This is the "raw main-gate command form" list the archive-gate.sh
# single-source PRD exists to keep at zero copies outside its own
# section. Extend this file (do not hardcode a new pattern into
# skill-prose-lint.sh) the next time a duplicated command needs the same
# treatment — see the PRD's Open question about worktree-extend.sh add.
gate-launch\.sh .*--scope main
extend-gate\.sh .*--head
